-opus-5-5-max-effort","94.6%","claude-opus-5-5",1,"gpt-6-astra-max","94.7%","gpt-6-astra","key","livebench-reasoning","name","LiveBench · 推理与数学","operator","LiveBench","description","Reasoning + Mathematics 两项均分，各占 50%。","status","ranked","brand",{"_216":217,"_218":219,"_220":16},"budget",0.042,"fullName","area","推理","group",{"_184":215,"_186":200},"officialUrl","https://livebench.ai/#/?cats=Reasoning%2CMathematics&ft=1","what","先分别计算 Reasoning、Mathematics 的分类成绩，再各占 50% 求平均，最后保留一位小数。两项均分与官网单独选择某一类的成绩不同。","usage","两项均分作为一份证据参与排名，各专项共用 LiveBench 证据家族；Global Average 仅供参考，不重复计票。","limits","两项均分衡量组合表现，不能当成 Reasoning 单项成绩。官方页面切换分类或是否包含微调模型时，分数与排序会随之变化。组织参与方 Abacus.AI 同时开发 Smaug 模型，其独家成绩需要其他独立来源补充。","license","Apache 2.0","attribution","分项成绩由 LiveBench 发布，AIHOT 按上述两类等权汇总并排序。两项均分与 AIHOT 共识分使用不同尺度，不能直接相加。","reasoning","src","/leaderboard-sources/livebench.png","monogram","L","raster","id","w6iq05cp87v3obts5ehlkyzkg","methodologyVersion","2026.09-public-consensus-v15","generatedAt","2026-09-29T18:06:22.108Z","fx",{"_229":230,"_231":232,"_233":234},"rate",6.7034,"asOf","2026-09-29","sourceName","欧洲央行",{"_236":237},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00"]
